    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds good, but some people in the neighborhood are really pushing back. They're saying it'll ruin the character of the area and cause all kinds of problems. How should I address those specific concerns in my presentation so they don't sound like they're just trying to block progress?",
      "source": "evaluator"
