    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. but honestly, it feels like a lot of their arguments are just NIMBY-ism, right? like they're just being selfish and ignoring the housing crisis. do you think it's actually worth spending time on their \"character\" arguments, or should I just focus on why the density is objectively better for the city's growth?",
